Min Heap and Max Heap using PriorityQueue

Write a program to implement a Min Heap and a Max Heap using PriorityQueue. Insert the elements 10, 20 and 15, then print the top element, 
remove the top element and print it, and finally print the new top element.

Diagram:

MIN HEAP (smallest on top)

      10
     /  \
   20    15

MAX HEAP (largest on top)

      20
     /  \
   10    15

Examples:

Min Heap
Output: 10 10 15

Max Heap
Output: 20 20 15


